  "body": "`camcraft-app` on main (3a41f7b4) does not compile:\n\n```\nerror[E0004]: non-exhaustive patterns: `&Warning::HolderHit { .. }` not covered\n   --> crates/app/src/warned_moves.rs:23:11\n```\n\n#350 (merged 12:07Z) added `warned_moves::moves_named`, which matches every `Warning` variant. #395 (merged 14:30Z) added `Warning::HolderHit`. The two PRs merged cleanly one after the other, but the combined tree breaks. Every PR branch that merges main now fails to build.\n\nDone means: `moves_named` names a `HolderHit`'s `at` move, as it does for the other single-move warnings, and main builds.\n",
